OL,3,GNEWSALandmark seaside sculpture could
OL,4,Abe on the move
OL,5,
OL,6,FA landmark seaside sculpture could be
OL,7,Frelocated as part of a plan to save it.
OL,9,FThe statue of Freddie Gilroy and the
OL,10,FBelsen Stragglers has faced the North
OL,11,FSea in Scarborough for 15 years, but
OL,12,Fcould soon be moved due to concerns
OL,13,Fabout weathering and deterioration.
OL,15,FSculptor Ray Lonsdale's work depicts a
OL,16,Ffriend of the artist, a former soldier
OL,17,Fwho participated in the liberation of
OL,18,FBergen-Belsen concentration camp in
OL,19,F1945, sitting on a bench in his old
OL,20,Fage.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,388,380,200,160,0,100
