OL,3,GNEWSALandmark seaside sculpture could
OL,4,Abe on the move
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Scarborough Town Council report said
OL,7,Fa move would be the "perfect
OL,8,Fopportunity to undertake repairs and
OL,9,Frestoration", which could extend the
OL,10,Fstatue's life for a further 15 years.
